<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,631.42 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,631.42 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's BUX index finished officially at a fourth successive closing high of 7,631.42 points, up 25.82, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover rose to 7.034 billion forints from Friday's 4.466 billion forints.</p>
</text>
